WordCraft for the VAIO — everyday use

Open WordCraft from the Office menu or VAIO App Launcher. The VAIO build uses a
steady caret and reduced animations to keep idle CPU use low. Its initial window
fits the 1600 x 768 screen. You can resize it normally.

Use Ctrl+O to open a document, Ctrl+S to save, and F12 / Save As for a new name or
format. DOCX is the normal working format. ODT, RTF, HTML, Markdown and plain text
were checked with a four-page synthetic report. Enter the desired extension when
choosing another format, for example report.odt. A bare Save As name gets the
suggested document extension. Replacing an existing file requires confirmation.

Ctrl+F finds text. The Home tab provides formatting and find/replace. Ctrl+Z and
Ctrl+Y undo and redo. Tables, pictures, headings, lists, headers and footers were
checked in ordinary documents. Keep an original copy before exchanging complex
layouts with other word processors; not every upstream feature has been audited.

Use Export PDF for sharing or printing elsewhere. File > Print previews the
pages and discovers printers configured in the system. No physical printer is
configured on this VAIO, so physical output has not been tested. A four-page PDF
with searchable accented, Greek and Cyrillic text and an embedded picture passed.

The VAIO is CPU-rendered. Short reports are the tested working range; large
image-heavy documents may be slow. The app's advanced upstream features remain
available, but this port is not a promise of Microsoft Word compatibility.

VAIO App Launcher saves its view, theme and language choices. Refresh verifies
new project metadata with APT in a user cache, without asking for administrator
access. Offline checks report the problem and retain saved package information.
Installation and updates still use APT and ask for local administrator access.
The existing Check & Install Updates tool can also update these packages.

Application packages: wordcraft-vaio, artcraft-launcher-vaio.
Project sources and signed archive: https://github.com/kennvanhauen/vaio-artcraft-apt
